{
  "uid": "pluton-llm-performance",
  "title": "LLM Performance",
  "description": "Throughput, latency and schema adherence per model and role. On macOS the tokens/s panel is the GPU-utilisation proxy \u2014 see ARCHITECTURE.md \u00a712.1.",
  "tags": [
    "pluton"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Throughput",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Output tokens/s by model (p50)",
      "description": "**This is the GPU panel on macOS.** Apple exposes no Prometheus-compatible GPU counters, so there is no utilisation series to plot (\u00a712.1). A sustained drop here means the model spilled out of GPU memory to CPU \u2014 the p05 line is where that shows up first.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, model) (rate(pluton_llm_tokens_per_second_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.05, sum by (le, model) (rate(pluton_llm_tokens_per_second_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} p05",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tokens/s now (p50, all models)",
      "description": "Below ~5 tok/s the platform is unusable in practice; the PlutonLlmThroughputCollapsed rule fires there.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 32
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(pluton_llm_tokens_per_second_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "tok/s",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate",
      "description": "Model calls that raised \u2014 a dropped Ollama connection, a timeout. Distinct from a call that returned unusable JSON, which is the repair ladder below.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 19,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 32
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(pluton_llm_requests_total{outcome=\"error\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(pluton_llm_requests_total[$__range])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "errors",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Token rate by direction",
      "description": "`in` is prompt evaluation, `out` is generation. A large and growing `in` with flat `out` means prompts are bloating \u2014 the truncation ladders in AGENTS.md \u00a77 exist for this.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": null,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "pluton-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (direction) (rate(pluton_llm_tokens_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{direction}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
