      "title": "Cache hits by kind",
      "description": "**Expected to be empty in this build.** \u00a712.1 defines this counter and the recording helper exists, but no LLM or embedding cache is wired up yet, so there is nothing to hit. It is a hit counter only \u2014 a ratio would need a miss counter the specification does not define.",
